X: 1
T: Grow for Me
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: Seymour's doo-wop shuffle from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 3) of
N: a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7933), moved up a tone from Bb to C so the range fits
N: the recorder; chords fitted from the MIDI's accompaniment (I7-IV7 doo-wop with
N: G7 and Ab7 colour). The source's swing is straightened; pitches are the
N: source's. One pass: the verse and its varied repeat (source bars 13-37). The
N: bridge that follows modulates chromatically and is left out.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
